      )
    )
  )
  (fn-do + intern-context U32
    (param styles (list TypeId))
    (param sheets (list TypeId))
    (param levels (list U32))
    (param scopes (list RuleScope))
    (param cells (list U32))
    (param made TypeId)
    (param layer U32)
    (param valued (list U32))
    (param value-types (list TypeId))
    ; The number among `contexts` of the styles, style sheets and rules written in rules given, in
    ; their order, each sheet in its group as `levels` gives them, which are renumbered from 0, each
    ; rule with how many state cells of its `when`s are given with it (`cells`) and the place of the
    ; values of the rule around it given with it (`valued`, empty where none are), of the class of
    ; the object whose content of a class above it is made, or no type, and of the `layer` of
    ; generated content, or 0; the values given are of the types `value-types`. Made at the first,
    ; and none where there are none.
