  )
  (fn-expr + context-values U32
    (param context U32)
    ; How many values a context gives: the state cells of the `when`s around each rule written in a
    ; rule that are given with it, then the values of the rules around them, as the reference gives the
    ; values of the frames of each in turn. That of generated content gives none: its flags say
    ; which rules are seen under a cell it is not given.
